  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust (LSETF)- MODs Salon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant is part of USADF&apos;s co-funding partnership with Lagos State Employment Trust Fund. MODS Salon/ Body Refinement Ltd is proposing to deliver hair salon skills training for 75 unemployed Lagos State residents. They plan to place a number of graduates with other hair salons who have indicated interest in skilled manpower. The company plans to equip all beneficiaries with both employability and entrepreneurial skills to become a success in the industry.</narrative>
  </description>
